avm-ac2 implements a binding between two independently published protocols and
claims nothing over either:

  * AC2 (Agentic Communication and Control), a Draft specification published by
    the Algorand Foundation at https://github.com/algorandfoundation/ac2. This
    package does not redistribute AC2 code: the `@algorandfoundation/ac2-sdk`
    npm package (Apache-2.0) is used from the JavaScript side and is not bundled
    here.

  * avm-mesh, by AlgoVoi (Apache-2.0), which supplies the sealed settlement
    receipt format and the canonicalising function this package imports rather
    than duplicating.

